"notes": "The potency of these cookies depends on the strength of your starting flower and the infusion efficiency. Always start by consuming a small portion (e.g., half a cookie) and wait 90-120 minutes to gauge the effects. Keep these clearly labeled and stored safely away from children and pets.",
